  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Creative Arts Center</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-5723 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-creative-arts-center tag-karen-marshall-shortsleeve tag-member-show tag-phylis-charles\" id=\"post-5723\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/members-exhibition/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"672\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Karen Shortsleeve: West Harwich: Oils,  First Place Award  in the Creative Arts Center Members Show, March 8- April 2, 2021.\" src=\"/media/archive/02c02be263f53a973c27f945ab56a03aaf333e8c00823803f550e191cc338f0d.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/members-exhibition/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Members’ Exhibition</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2021-03-13T09:22:07-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, March 13, 2021, 9:22 am\">March 13, 2021</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Creative Arts Center in Chatham presents the 2021 Members’ Exhibition from March 8 – April 2, 2021. “The Members’ Exhibition is a sampling of works from our talented members. <a href=\"/news/members-exhibition/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3797 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-gallery-artists category-news tag-all-works-square tag-creative-arts-center tag-peggy-masce-hosford\" id=\"post-3797\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/hosford-exhibits-in-all-works-square/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"487\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Hosford took Honorable Mention for &quot;Brewster Herring Run&quot;\" src=\"/media/archive/522d5a9d0677e5079e94c1d6251a8a184a7cacfaf55c2456b1ac2ba98b850083.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/hosford-exhibits-in-all-works-square/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Hosford Exhibits in ‘All Works Square’</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-05-17T09:38:01-04:00\" title=\"Thursday, May 17, 2018, 9:38 am\">May 17, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Guild of Harwich Artist, Peggy Masce Hosford took Honorable Mention for her painting, “Brewster Herring Run” in the “All Works Square” Exhibit at the Creative Arts Center, 154 Crowell Rd., <a href=\"/news/hosford-exhibits-in-all-works-square/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3712 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-artweek category-education category-news tag-creative-arts-center tag-family-pantry-of-cape-cod tag-hrwich-cultural-center tag-robin-litwin\" id=\"post-3712\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"848\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A group of people holding up their paintings in front of a table.\" src=\"/media/archive/b3414b5ff4822236a7666b5494414c7eab8e1ef25f88437948fee23f500c02de.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild Member Robin Litwin Offers Encaustic Instruction</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-04-18T12:38:45-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, April 18, 2018, 12:38 pm\">April 18, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>I have been loving encaustic painting for the past five years and want to thank Mary Moquin for helping me in countless ways; she is the most generous and gifted <a href=\"/news/guild-member-robin-litwin-offers-encaustic-instruction/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2778 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-news tag-22nd-all-cape-cod-art-show tag-cape-cod-art-galleries tag-creative-arts-center tag-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-2778\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/members-exhibit-in-22nd-annual-all-cape-cod-show/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"508\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A woman standing in front of a painting of a nude woman.\" src=\"/media/archive/bfb6247ca360a8f10ed592126d3fe6197cdacb1946c7f0f6210f212ebfec6281.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/members-exhibit-in-22nd-annual-all-cape-cod-show/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Members Exhibit in ’22nd Annual All Cape Cod Show’</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-06-14T13:51:59-04:00\" title=\"Wednesday, June 14, 2017, 1:51 pm\">June 14, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Creative Arts Center in Chatham is currently holding its 22nd Annual All Cape Cod Art Show – Open Juried Exhibition through Wednesday, June 28. Many Guild of Harwich Artists <a href=\"/news/members-exhibit-in-22nd-annual-all-cape-cod-show/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-2612 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-events category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-cape-cod-abstract-artist tag-cape-cod-art-association tag-creative-arts-center tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-ma tag-norma-ann-mutch\" id=\"post-2612\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/mutch-demonstrates-at-guild-monthly-meeting/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"667\" height=\"500\" alt=\"An older woman standing in front of a painting.\" src=\"/media/archive/84f5000a056cab2449b80b4204e73c6d468a8ac2fdbd78a9da12385d12d07632.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/mutch-demonstrates-at-guild-monthly-meeting/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Mutch Demonstrates at Guild Monthly Meeting</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-02-19T23:43:21-05:00\" title=\"Sunday, February 19, 2017, 11:43 pm\">February 19, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>On Saturday, February 18, The Guild of Harwich Artists hosted Cape Cod abstract artist and Guild of Harwich Artist member, Norma Ann Mutch. Ms. Mutch discussed her career as an <a href=\"/news/mutch-demonstrates-at-guild-monthly-meeting/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
